<messaging:emailTemplate subject="Delivery Group Stage Approval Required" recipientType="User" relatedToType="KimbleOne__DeliveryGroupStage__c"><messaging:htmlEmailBody > <html> <body style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f0f0f;text-align:left;"> <table width="600px" align="left" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;margin-top:20px;"> <tr><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;padding-bottom:5px;padding-top:10px;padding-right:5px;border-bottom-width:1px;border-left-style:none;border-bottom-style:solid;border-right-style:none;"><apex:image id="KimbleLogo" value="{!$Setup.KimbleOne__KimbleOneConfigSetting__c.KimbleOne__EmailTemplateLogoURL__c}"/></td></tr> <tr><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1em;font-size:1em;font-weight:bold;padding-top:10px;">Engagement requires approval before progressing to the next Delivery Stage.</td></tr> <tr><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1em;font-size:1em;font-weight:bold;padding-top:10px;padding-bottom:8px;border-bottom-width:1px;border-bottom-style:solid;">Reference: {!relatedTo.KimbleOne__DeliveryGroup__r.Name}</td></tr> <tr><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;padding-bottom:10px;">Follow the&nbsp;<apex:outputlink value="{!LEFT($Api.Partner_Server_URL_140,FIND('.com',$Api.Partner_Server_URL_140)+4)+relatedTo.Id}">Link</apex:outputlink> to view this Stage in Kimble.</td></tr> <tr><td align="left" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;padding-bottom:10px;"> <table style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;border-collapse:collapse;"> <tr><td align="right" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;"><b>{!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__DeliveryGroupStage__c.Fields.Name.Label}:</b></td><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;"> {!relatedTo.KimbleOne__DeliveryStage__r.Name}</td></tr> <tr><td align="right" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;"><b>{!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__DeliveryGroup__c.Fields.KimbleOne__ForecastStatus__c.Label}: </b></td><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;">{!relatedTo.KimbleOne__DeliveryGroup__r.KimbleOne__ForecastStatus__r.Name}</td></tr> <tr><td align="right" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;"><b>{!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__DeliveryGroup__c.Fields.KimbleOne__ContractRevenue__c.Label}:</b></td><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;"> <apex:outputText value="{0, number, {!relatedTo.KimbleOne__DeliveryGroup__r.CurrencyIsoCode} #,##0.00}"> <apex:param value="{!relatedTo.KimbleOne__DeliveryGroup__r.KimbleOne__ContractRevenue__c}"></apex:param> </apex:outputText></td></tr> <tr><td align="right" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;"><b>{!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__DeliveryGroup__c.Fields.KimbleOne__WeightedContractRevenue__c.Label}:</b></td><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;"> <apex:outputText value="{0, number, {!relatedTo.KimbleOne__DeliveryGroup__r.CurrencyIsoCode} #,##0.00}"> <apex:param value="{!relatedTo.KimbleOne__DeliveryGroup__r.KimbleOne__WeightedContractRevenue__c}"></apex:param> </apex:outputText></td></tr> </table> </td></tr> <tr><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;padding-bottom:10px;">You can approve or reject completion of this Delivery Stage, by replying to this email and entering either <span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#1a8d4a;font-weight:bold;">APPROVED</span> or <span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#dd1d2e;font-weight:bold;">REJECTED</span> in the first line together with any comments in the second line. If you have any queries regarding this confirmation please contact the project owner.</td></tr> <tr><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;padding-bottom:10px;border-bottom-width:1px;border-bottom-style:solid;">Regards<br/>{!$Organization.Name} {!$Label.kimbleone__emailtemplatesignature}</td></tr> </table> </body> </html></messaging:htmlEmailBody><messaging:plainTextEmailBody >{!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__DeliveryGroup__c.Label} {!relatedTo.KimbleOne__DeliveryGroup__r.Name} requires approval before progressing to the next Delivery Stage.{!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__DeliveryGroupStage__c.Fields.Name.Label}: <apex:outputText value="{!relatedTo.KimbleOne__DeliveryStage__r.Name}" /> {!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__DeliveryGroup__c.Fields.KimbleOne__ForecastStatus__c.Label}: <apex:outputText value="{!relatedTo.KimbleOne__DeliveryGroup__r.KimbleOne__ForecastStatus__r.Name}"/> {!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__DeliveryGroup__c.Fields.KimbleOne__ContractRevenue__c.Label}: <apex:outputText value="{0, number, {!relatedTo.KimbleOne__DeliveryGroup__r.CurrencyIsoCode} #,##0.00}"> <apex:param value="{!relatedTo.KimbleOne__DeliveryGroup__r.KimbleOne__ContractRevenue__c}"></apex:param> </apex:outputText>{!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__DeliveryGroup__c.Fields.KimbleOne__WeightedContractRevenue__c.Label}:<apex:outputText value="{0, number, {!relatedTo.KimbleOne__DeliveryGroup__r.CurrencyIsoCode} #,##0.00}"> <apex:param value="{!relatedTo.KimbleOne__DeliveryGroup__r.KimbleOne__WeightedContractRevenue__c}"></apex:param> </apex:outputText>You can approve or reject completion of this Delivery Stage, by replying to this email and entering either APPROVED or REJECTED in the first line together with any comments in the second line. If you have any queries regarding this confirmation please contact the project owner. Regards {!$Organization.Name} {!$Label.kimbleone__emailtemplatesignature} </messaging:plainTextEmailBody></messaging:emailTemplate>